\cite[Theorem 3.6]{JoshiShiu17}\label{thm:1species} Let $\cal N$ be a reaction network on one species. Then 
\begin{itemize}
\item[1.] $\cal N$ has the capacity for MPE if and only it is a 2-alternating network or the arrow diagram of $\cal N$ is either $\leftarrow\!\!\bullet\!\!\rightarrow$ or
